source: crates/standalone/fixture/src/lib.rs
---
Add a person to an organization.

Usage: ink org member add [OPTIONS] <ORG> <ACCOUNT>

Arguments
  <ORG>      The organization's id
  <ACCOUNT>  The person's account id

Options
      --role <ROLE>  What they may do: owner, admin, writer or reader
                     [default: reader]

Account
      --api <URL>          The API's address, `http://host[:port]`;
                           `account.api` in the config file [env: INK_API]
      --timeout <SECONDS>  Seconds one call may take [default: 30]
                           [env: INK_TIMEOUT]

Global  -C, --json, -q, -v, --color, --no-progress, --log, --log-file
        (see `ink --help`)
More    ink org member add --help adds examples, notes and exit codes
